        "Content": "LWK Group in association with Keane Mahony Smith\r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\nAn absolutely superb family home in a most sought-after location convenient to all services and amenities, being only a short drive from Ballincollig Town Centre, with easy access to Cork City via the N40 Road Network. The well-maintained accommodation is laid out as follows: Hallway, Living Room with solid fuel stove, modern fully fitted Kitchen/Dining Room, all at ground floor level. Stairs then leading to landing with Hotpress and Stira to attic storage, three bedrooms (one with en-suite) and a bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside – Parking for two vehicles to the front. Professionally laid out tiered rear garden and patio area.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\n\r\nHall 3.6m x 1.75m\r\n\r\nLiving Room 3.9m x 3.45m\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room 3.6m x 5.3m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 3.25m x 3.4m\r\n\r\nEnsuite 0.78m x 2.5m with shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 3.42m x 3.0m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 2.4m x 2.35m\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.4m x 2.35m\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area – C. 80 sq. m–860 sq. ft.\r\n\r\nHall: laminated timber effect floor, understairs storage.\r\n\r\nLiving room: solid fuel stove, laminated timber effect flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen: Extensive built in eye & floor level units. Extraction hood, laminated timber effect flooring, sliding patio door to landscaped rear garden.\r\n\r\nBed 1: double built-in robe\r\n\r\nBathroom: fully tiled.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\n❖ BER C2\r\n❖ Gas Central Heating and solid fuel stove\r\n❖ Double glazing throughout\r\n❖ Built in 1998\r\n❖ Well laid out south facing rear garden\r\n❖ Easy access to Ballincollig Town Centre, Ballincollig Regional Park and a 20-minute drive to Cork City Centre\r\n❖ Quality Wood flooring throughout the ground floor,\r\n❖ Integrated appliances in the Kitchen to include a dishwasher and washing machine\r\n❖ Built-in wardrobes in all bedrooms\r\n❖ All the interior freshly decorated.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
